During the [[clash on Nevarro]]<ref name="Chapter 8" /> in [[9 ABY]],<ref name="Date">{{MandoDate|7|[[clash on Nevarro]]}}</ref> [[Moff]] [[Gideon]] was accompanied by a '''battalion''' of [[stormtrooper]]s from his [[Gideon's Imperial remnant|Imperial remnant]], including his [[death trooper]] [[Gideon's guard|guard]], that served as his escort. The [[battalion]] fought the [[Mandalorian]] [[bounty hunter]] [[Din Djarin]] and his allies outside a [[Nevarro school|Nevarro cantina]] before the stormtroopers forced them to retreat inside. Gideon ordered an [[Incinerator stormtrooper|incinerator trooper]] to burn them out, but [[Din Grogu]] used [[the Force]] to send the flames back. Djarin and the others escaped into the [[Nevarro sewer|sewers]] and, while they were pursued, eventually defeated Gideon and his forces.<ref name="Chapter 8" /> According to [[Carasynthia Dune|Cara Dune]], the battalion came from the [[Nevarro Imperial base]].<ref name="Chapter 12" />

{{Military-stub}}

==Behind the scenes==
Gideon's battalion first appeared in "[[Chapter 7: The Reckoning]]"<ref name="Chapter 7">{{TheMandalorian|Chapter 7: The Reckoning}}</ref> and was identified as a battalion in the descriptive audio of "[[Chapter 8: Redemption]]."<ref name="Chapter 8" />

